  var welcomes = {"/days-out":["UK days out, your way","Big rides, a lazy wander or somewhere cracking for lunch? Find a town, attraction or activity to get excited about, then put your day together. Leave a little room for the place you spot on the way — that is usually when the plan gets interesting."],"/seaside":["UK seaside days out","Sea air, a walk on the prom and chips that somebody is already eyeing up. Explore seaside towns, beaches, piers and things to do nearby. Make a day of it, or stay for the weekend. Keep an eye on your lunch; the seagulls have their own plans."],"/beaches":["Beaches in England and around the UK","Sandy toes, sea air and a day with a bit of room to breathe. Find beaches and coastal towns for a wander, a paddle or a proper seaside outing. Brighton even has an official naturist beach by Black Rock — one way to keep the washing down. Pick your kind of coast, then add a food stop."],"/piers":["UK piers and promenade adventures","Walk out over the sea, stop for the view and see what is happening along the pier. These guides bring together seaside piers, promenades and the towns around them. Bring your camera, leave time for chips and expect somebody to say, ‘Just a quick look in the amusements.’"],"/attractions":["UK attractions worth a day out","A big coaster, a castle, a wildlife park or something you have never tried? Explore attractions around the UK and find the main event for your day. Check the individual guide for the practical bits, then leave enough time to enjoy yourself. Lunch can join the adventure too."],"/theme-parks":["UK theme parks and family rides","Rollercoasters, family rides and that brave face just before the drop. Find a UK theme park that suits your gang, then check the rides, tickets and age or height rules. You can debate who screamed loudest over something to eat afterwards."],"/family-fun":["Family days out across the UK","Find an outing the whole gang can get into: activities, attractions and places to explore together. Check the ages and access details in the venue guide, then build in a food break. Happy children, tired legs and somebody asleep on the way home — that is a decent result."],"/zoos":["UK zoos and wildlife parks","Pick your favourite animal, then discover three more before lunch. Explore UK zoos and wildlife parks, with individual guides to help you choose a day that suits your group. Check feeding talks and opening times before you go; the animals are working to their own timetable."],"/sea-life":["UK aquariums and sea-life days out","A whole world beneath the water, and plenty to make you stop and stare. Find UK aquariums and sea-life attractions for an indoor adventure, then explore the town nearby. You can admire the creatures without getting your socks wet. That is a bonus."],"/museums":["UK museums and galleries to explore","Big stories, odd discoveries and the thing you did not expect to spend half an hour looking at. Find museums and galleries around the UK, then check exhibitions and activities in the individual guide. Leave time for a proper nosey around and a café stop afterwards."],"/historical-sites":["UK castles, heritage and historic places","Castles, grand houses, ruins and stories with a few centuries behind them. Explore historic places around the UK and see which one catches your eye. Check the walking and access details first. Those old staircases were clearly built before anybody thought about a comfortable day out."],"/outdoors":["UK outdoor days out and country escapes","Fresh air, room to roam and a very respectable reason to stop at a café. Explore parks, gardens, countryside and waterside walks around the UK. Pick a route that suits your group and pack for the weather. The muddy boots can be tomorrow’s problem."],"/hidden-gems":["Hidden gems and unusual UK days out","The little place you nearly walked past might be the best bit of the day. Find unusual attractions and quieter discoveries around the UK, then open a guide to see what is there. Leave a gap in the plan. A good nosey around occasionally deserves its own afternoon."],"/tours":["UK tours and experiences","Let somebody show you the stories you would have walked straight past. Explore tours, guided walks and experiences around the UK, then check the meeting point and what is included. Turn up with a little curiosity; there is usually more going on than you think."],"/bowling":["UK bowling alleys and a little rivalry","You said it was just a bit of fun. Then somebody got a strike. Find UK bowling venues for a family outing, a night with friends or a rainy-day plan. Check sessions and bookings, then sort a food stop. The winner will probably remind you on the way home."],"/cinemas":["UK cinemas and a proper movie night","A big screen, a comfortable seat and a couple of hours away from the outside world. Find cinemas around the UK and check the venue’s current film listings before choosing a session. Add food before or afterwards. Whoever finishes the popcorn before the film starts is buying the next lot."],"/food-and-drink":["Food and drink for your UK day out","A proper pub lunch, chips by the sea or a curry worth making a stop for. Find restaurants, cafés and takeaways that fit your day, then see what is nearby. Masala & Malt in Grimsby is October’s featured food stop. A soggy sandwich in the car can have the day off."],"/places-to-stay":["UK hotels and places to stay","Enjoy the evening, get a good night’s kip and explore a little more tomorrow. Find hotels and accommodation around the UK, then check the location, room and booking details. Breakfast and parking are worth a look too; surprises are more fun when they are places to visit."],"/holiday-parks":["UK holiday parks and short breaks","Unpack, put the kettle on and enjoy having a few days ahead of you. Explore holiday parks and places for a UK break, with guides to help you check accommodation and activities. Have a look at what is included before booking. Then the important question is what you fancy doing first."],"/fishing-lakes":["UK fishing lakes and country breaks","Find your water, get settled and give the day a bit of peace. Explore fishing lakes, fisheries and country escapes around the UK. Check tickets, tackle rules and access with the venue before setting off. A flask and something decent to eat make excellent travelling companions."],"/arcade":["UK amusement arcades and places to play","Lights, games and somebody who is certain they can win that cuddly toy. Find seaside amusements, family arcades and other gaming venues around the UK. Open a venue card for its own guide, and check the venue type before taking children. There is always room for a little play time."],"/agc":["UK adult gaming centres","Find adult gaming centres, recognise the entrance and open the venue’s own guide before travelling. These are adult-only venues, with different arrangements from family amusements. Looking for the older machines themselves? The Fruit Machine Archive has their own descriptions ready for a proper look around."],"/500-jackpot-slots":["UK adult gaming venues and jackpot machines","Find an adult gaming venue, recognise its entrance and see what information is available before travelling. Open the venue card for its own guide. Interested in classic machines? Their makers, artwork and features have a separate home in the Fruit Machine Archive."],"/arcade-bars":["UK arcade bars and games nights","A drink, a controller and the sudden discovery that your mate is very competitive. Explore UK arcade bars and social gaming venues, then check booking and age policies before going. Add something to eat and make an evening of it. The score can settle the argument."],"/retro-video-games":["UK retro arcades and classic video games","The music starts and you remember exactly where that button is. Find UK retro arcades and places to play classic video games. Open a venue guide to plan a visit, or head to the separate Fruit Machine Archive for reels, nudges and a different sort of nostalgia."],"/classic-fruit-machines":["Classic UK fruit-machine archive","Reels, nudges, familiar artwork and the names you remember. Explore classic UK fruit machines by maker and era. Every machine card opens its own description; venue cards open the place where you can visit. Settle in for a proper look around — there is plenty of nostalgia here."],"/fruit-machine-manufacturers":["Classic fruit-machine makers","Barcrest, JPM and the makers behind the machines you remember. Explore the manufacturer sections, then open an individual machine card for its artwork, features and description. That familiar logo might send you down a very enjoyable rabbit hole."],"/bingo-halls":["UK bingo halls and evenings out","Eyes down, a catch-up and a bit of an occasion. Find UK bingo halls, then check current session times, prices and entry arrangements with the venue. These are adult-only venues. Pick somewhere for food beforehand and give the evening a proper start."],"/services":["Useful stops for your UK trip","Get the practical bits sorted and leave more time for the fun. Browse local services and useful stops, then open the individual guide for location and contact information. The destination pages can help you join the rest of the day together."],"/plan-a-trip":["Plan a UK day out worth getting up for","Pick the main event, add a food stop and see what else is nearby. Build a UK day out or a short break that suits your group, with enough time to enjoy each stop. Leave a little space for a wander. The best discoveries rarely send a calendar invitation."],"/map":["Explore the UK days-out map","Start with the place, then find what is around it. Explore venues and ideas on the UK map, open a guide and join a few stops into a day out. A nearby food stop is always worth knowing about; nobody enjoys planning on an empty stomach."],"/offers":["Food, hotels and UK days-out offers","A night away, a good food stop or tickets for something to look forward to. Explore the offers and check dates, availability and what is included before booking. Some booking links support Spin Raiders through commission. A deal is best when it fits a day you actually want."],"/casino-offers":["UK casino affiliate offers","Browse the operator offers and check each operator’s current terms before choosing. These are adult-only gambling services, separate from our family days-out and amusement guides. The real-world venue and classic-machine archives are there when you fancy exploring those instead."]};
